[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831747494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2831747494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2831747494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oyQmm","user":{"login":"liryu1973","id":64412290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDEyMjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64412290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973","html_url":"https://github.com/liryu1973","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T02:18:01Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T02:18:01Z","body":"https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/physics/physics_introduction.html\nI know that the above URL's Important says “Do not change Scale”, but is there any way this specification can be resolved?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831747494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831791854","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2831791854","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2831791854,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oybbu","user":{"login":"ghmart","id":7192155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTIxNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7192155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart","html_url":"https://github.com/ghmart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T03:17:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T03:21:02Z","body":"Not sure if non-uniform scaling of \"standard\" collision shapes (such as circle) is bug-free in any game engine. See this issue, for example: https://forums.unrealengine.com/t/non-uniform-scale-collision-issues/277362/2.\n\nBut in Godot you can create your own custom CollisionPolygon2D and scale it.\n\nLink to small tutorial on creating CollisionPolygon2D: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YkBOKtA9gCI.\n\nI've attached your project with custom (very rough) circle-like CollisionPolygon2D and it seems to work as you wish. It should be tested more thoroughly, of course.\n\n[non_uniform.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19919974/non_uniform.zip)\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831791854/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831841648","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2831841648","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2831841648,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oynlw","user":{"login":"liryu1973","id":64412290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDEyMjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64412290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973","html_url":"https://github.com/liryu1973","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T04:43:48Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T04:43:48Z","body":"Thanks for your kindness. However, that file froze and did not work when I ran it here. If there is such a specification for physics, I think you should at least issue a warning, make the scale inoperable, or add a function to convert it to Polygon, or do something about it.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831841648/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831893225","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2831893225","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2831893225,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oy0Lp","user":{"login":"ghmart","id":7192155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTIxNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7192155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart","html_url":"https://github.com/ghmart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T06:14:07Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T06:14:07Z","body":"Well, I've discovered this myself only thanks to your post. Not even sure that this is a good method to use. If so, then I'd agree that something could be mentioned in documentation. Let's wait for replies from more experienced developers.\n\nBetter not to guess, but to my understanding, when you use \"standard\" collision shapes, the physics system have to deal with mathematical representation of relevant \"perfect\" shapes, so it uses special (more performant and error-resistant?) algorithm that don't account for scaling (non-uniform at the very least).\n\nYour idea on function to convert shape to polygon sounds interesting, but there are numerous nuances. If this is circle or capsule shape - with what resolution it should be converted to polygon? Would it be function parameter? How this functionality will be represented in editor? Some default project setting? Most importantly - is that good enough (and urgent enough) reason for team members / contributors to spend their time on implementing this?\n\nJust found old discussion on reddit: https://www.reddit.com/r/godot/comments/agupcp/if_you_must_never_ever_ever_scale_your_collision/\n\nHave no idea what's wrong with my zip file. What do you mean by \"ran it here\"? You have to download it, unzip and then open in Godot editor. If it won't unpack you could try some other decompression software like 7zip (though I'm sure you've already made your own custom polygon at this time).\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831893225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831947901","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2831947901","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2831947901,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozBh9","user":{"login":"liryu1973","id":64412290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDEyMjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64412290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973","html_url":"https://github.com/liryu1973","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T08:03:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T08:03:49Z","body":"I was able to open the project you prepared with Godot. However, when I ran it, it froze and the only way was to force quit. Why that happened is a mystery. I am afraid to try it again, but I did confirm that it was converted to Polygon when I opened it with Godot.\n\nBy the way, I was discussing this issue with Grok3, and to my surprise, they made a conversion asset. And it is possible to have multiple at the same time. There was a fatal bug for a while, but now it is finally fixed and I upload it here. Please refer to the video for how to use it. Grok says to let him know if there are any bugs.\n\n[circle_to_polygon.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19921234/circle_to_polygon.zip)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b04d30b8-88fa-4379-af61-2ce771a76f71","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831947901/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832059554","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2832059554","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2832059554,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ozcyi","user":{"login":"ghmart","id":7192155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxOTIxNTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7192155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart","html_url":"https://github.com/ghmart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghmart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T11:53:17Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T11:53:17Z","body":"Nice plugin! If this is all you want - that's great!\n\nConversion purges any node's transforms though. If you'd want 20 circle shapes positioned + rotated + scaled + skewed differently, this plugin would create 20 different polygons. The more polygons the harder level tweaking.\n\nThis can be improved further. If you create and save ConvexPolygonShape2D resource with custom circle-shaped polygon, you'll need only this one resource for any amount of collision shapes with different transforms without the need to convert them.\n\nThis can be achieved with plugin if it could save to resource.\n\nIf you want, modify plugin code yourself for one-time use. Add following code in function \"convert_circle_to_polygon\" right above \"return vertices\" line:\n\n```\nvar cs = ConvexPolygonShape2D.new()\ncs.points = vertices\nResourceSaver.save(cs, \"circle.tres\")\n```\nJust convert one untransformed circle shape using modified plugin and use generated \"circle.tres\" file for any amount of ConvexPolygonShape2D you need with different transforms.\n\nOne more benefit: you could copy and use \"circle.tres\" in any other project.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832059554/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832296028","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2832296028","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2832296028,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o0Whc","user":{"login":"liryu1973","id":64412290,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0NDEyMjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64412290?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973","html_url":"https://github.com/liryu1973","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/liryu1973/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T14:55:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T14:55:43Z","body":"https://www.reddit.com/r/godot/comments/agupcp/if_you_must_never_ever_ever_scale_your_collision/\nThe problem is that what has been said for the past 6 years has not been addressed at all. It seems to me that this is the point where users who have come all the way from Unity to Godot will be disappointed. Even if it is difficult to solve the fundamental problem of non-uniform scaling, there should at least be a workaround.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832296028/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832352893","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105776#issuecomment-2832352893","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105776","id":2832352893,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6o0kZ9","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-26T15:59:00Z","updated_at":"2025-04-26T16:06:53Z","body":"Thank you for reporting, this is already tracked in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/92205\n\nClosing to keep things in one place, this is a matter of a missing warning\n\nFdfor this specific case I'd suggest using a capsule shape instead","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2832352893/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"